meta {
  name: Get Product by Barcode
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/products/barcode/8850000000001
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Product by Barcode

  Looks up a product by its barcode.

  **Required capability:** `products.read`

  **URL parameter:** barcode (e.g., `8850000000001`)

  **Test barcodes (seeded in dev):**
  - `8850000000001` - น้ำดื่ม 600ml (7 baht)
  - `8850000000002` - โค้ก 325ml (15 baht)
  - `8850000000003` - มาม่าหมูสับ (6 baht)
  - `8850000000004` - ขนมปังปี๊บ (20 baht)
  - `8850000000005` - นมจืด 200ml (12 baht)
}
